# Scenario missing-cart-file (plan 04-20, D-20): outcome missing-fixture, exit 13. The cartridge
# path names no file in the content directory.
# expect-detail: missing role=cart path=absent-cart.ivsc
ivss 1
id missing-cart-file
profile intv-2609-ntsc-family-p1
content exec boot-stub
content grom zero-grom
content cart absent-cart.ivsc
run-to 4000 cpu-cycles stop halted
assert halted == yes
